{"id": "17-3847-2-15", "zh": "以 d 音、dh 音结尾的词根，在 tuna 等后缀之前，有时按照惯例插入 y 音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3847-16-31", "zh": "带有 y 音时，d 音变为 j 音，例如 samāpajjitvā、uppajjitvā、bhijjitvā、chijjitvā gato。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3847-32-52", "zh": "词根 budha 意为“理解”；依据“tathā kattari ca”这条规则，词根末音与 y 音一起变为同组辅音，得到 bujjhiya、bujjhitvā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3847-53-56", "zh": "virajjhiya、virajjhitvā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3847-57-60", "zh": "rundhiya、rundhitvā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3848-2-17", "zh": "“tunādīnaṃ”是延续下来的支配项，“vā”也是。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3849-2-7", "zh": "第 643 条：在以 c、n 结尾的词根之后，替换为 racca。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3850-2-31", "zh": "在以 c 音、n 音结尾的词根之后，tuna 等后缀可以替换为 racca；通过把“raccaṃ”拆成独立规则，其他词根之后也适用；或者，这里的“vā”一词表示有限定的选择；r 等音脱落。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-3850-32-51", "zh": "词根 vica 意为“分离”，前面加 vi：vivicca、viviccitvā；通过把“yo kvaci”拆成独立规则，插入 y 音。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3851-2-10", "zh": "词根 pava 意为“煮”：pacca、pacciya、paccitvā。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-3851-11-14", "zh": "vimucca、vimuccitvā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3852-2-13", "zh": "词根 hana 意为“伤害”和“行走”：āhacca、upahacca、āhantvā、upahantvā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3853-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**vā**（任选）”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3853-6-16", "zh": "例如 avamañña、avamaññitvā、mantvā；nya 变为 ña 音。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3854-2-15", "zh": "词根 i 意为“行走”，通过拆分规则替换为 racca：paṭicca、avecca、upecca，以及 upetvā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3854-16-27", "zh": "词根 kara 意为“做”：sakkacca、adhikicca；插入 i 音时得到 kariya。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3855-2-4", "zh": "词根 disa 意为“看见”——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3856-2-8", "zh": "第 644 条：在 disa 之后替换为 svāna、svā，并且末音脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3857-2-18", "zh": "在 disa 这个词根之后，tuna 等后缀可以替换为 svāna、svā，同时词根的末音脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3857-19-25", "zh": "例如“disvānassa etadahosi”（他看见后心里这样想）、“cakkhunā rūpaṃ disvā”（用眼睛看见色之后）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3858-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**vā**（任选）”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3858-6-10", "zh": "例如“nekkhammaṃ daṭṭhuṃ”（为了看见出离）、daṭṭhā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3858-11-16", "zh": "以及 passiya、passituna、passitvā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3859-2-6", "zh": "“anta”一词和“antalopa”一词延续下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3860-2-15", "zh": "第 645 条：在 ma、ha、da、bha 之后，替换为 mma、yha、jja、bbha、ddhā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3861-2-25", "zh": "在以 ma、ha、da、bha 这些音结尾的词根之后，tuna 等后缀依次可以替换为 mma、yha、jja、bbha、ddhā，同时词根的末音脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3861-26-32", "zh": "先说以 m 音结尾的：āgamma、āgantvā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3861-33-47", "zh": "词根 kamu 意为“迈步”：okkamma、okkamitvā、nikkhamma、nikkhamitvā、abhiramma、abhiramitvā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3862-2-9", "zh": "以 h 音结尾的：paggayha、paggaṇhitvā、paggahetvā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3862-10-27", "zh": "词根 muha 意为“迷惑”：sammuyha、sammuyhitvā，这里插入了 y 音；还有 āruyha、āruhitvā、ogayha、ogahetvā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3863-2-16", "zh": "以 d 音结尾的：uppajja、uppajjitvā、pamajja、pamajjitvā、upasampajja、upasampajjitvā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3863-17-31", "zh": "词根 chidi 意为“切成两半”：acchijja、chijja、chijjitvā、chindiya、chinditvā、chetvā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3864-2-13", "zh": "以 bh 音结尾的：词根 rabha 意为“急切”，例如“ārabbha kathesi”（就此而说）、āraddhā、ārabhitvā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3864-14-26", "zh": "词根 labha 意为“获得”：upalabbha、upaladdhā、“saddhaṃ paṭilabhitvā puññāni karonti”（获得信心之后行善）等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3865-2-3", "zh": "以 tave、tuna 等后缀结尾的词的构成法（完）。", "confidence": 65}
